WEBVTT

00:08.700 --> 00:15.340
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.340 --> 00:18.680
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.680 --> 00:21.980
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:21.980 --> 00:27.420
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo manzoku
suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.620 --> 00:34.560
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro no
sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.560 --> 00:36.630
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.630 --> 00:41.840
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka ni
kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.840 --> 00:44.910
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:44.910 --> 00:48.140
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.140 --> 00:51.780
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.780 --> 00:55.410
<b>ima sugu ni</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:08.000
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.000 --> 01:13.270
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no naka
jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.270 --> 01:16.370
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.370 --> 01:19.610
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.610 --> 01:23.180
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.180 --> 01:25.810
<b>ima sugu ni</b>

01:40.900 --> 01:42.360
<b>Looks like he's here.</b>

01:53.110 --> 01:55.680
<b>Wait, take them off.</b>

01:55.680 --> 01:57.610
<b>But Lord Homura...</b>

01:58.480 --> 02:00.620
<b>Never mind, just take them off.</b>

02:00.620 --> 02:02.080
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

02:03.450 --> 02:05.850
<b>Should I thank you?</b>

02:06.820 --> 02:09.620
<b>No, there's no need for that.</b>

02:09.620 --> 02:11.790
<b>But are you sure about this?</b>

02:11.790 --> 02:17.860
<b>I know what you did for me, but
I'm going to be killing you now.</b>

02:20.040 --> 02:21.500
<b>What's so funny?</b>

02:22.100 --> 02:27.780
<b>There's nothing to explain. We're
laughing because it's funny, moron.</b>

02:27.780 --> 02:29.110
<b>This isn't funny!</b>

02:29.710 --> 02:32.310
<b>He seems to at least have
a surplus of energy.</b>

02:32.980 --> 02:34.450
<b>Hey, you.</b>

02:35.280 --> 02:40.260
<b>If you can touch us, I'll let you go.</b>

02:40.260 --> 02:42.490
<b>I'll warn you beforehand.</b>

02:42.490 --> 02:44.720
<b>If you're going to beg for your life,
now's the time.</b>

02:46.960 --> 02:49.860
<b>It'll be too late by the time you've
become corpses after all.</b>

03:00.680 --> 03:03.310
<b>You'll now be reborn.</b>

03:03.310 --> 03:06.180
<b>As our servant, as a holy demon.</b>

03:11.290 --> 03:12.840
<b>Confer divinity.</b>

03:18.990 --> 03:21.160
<b>You have but one objective.</b>

03:21.160 --> 03:25.060
<b>To steal the Maten Scripture in
Genjo Sanzo's possession.</b>

03:26.200 --> 03:27.670
<b>Go.</b>

03:28.170 --> 03:29.670
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

03:29.670 --> 03:31.540
<b>For the sake of our ideology.</b>

03:34.110 --> 03:36.580
<b>Is that guy going to be able to do it?</b>

03:36.580 --> 03:40.720
<b>He's been strengthened,
but there's no guarantee.</b>

03:40.720 --> 03:44.280
<b>It's fine. That's about the right
level to start with.</b>

03:45.020 --> 03:47.250
<b>Isn't that right, Son Goku?</b>

04:02.240 --> 04:03.700
<b>I'm so tired.</b>

04:04.540 --> 04:07.410
<b>I'm too tired to even make fun
of the monkey.</b>

04:07.410 --> 04:10.650
<b>I'm too hungry to even yell
at the water sprite.</b>

04:10.650 --> 04:13.650
<b>Yes, yes, we'll be arriving
at a village soon,</b>

04:13.650 --> 04:15.920
<b>so be good boys and have patience.</b>

04:15.920 --> 04:17.380
<b>Okay.</b>

04:18.820 --> 04:20.290
<b>Morons.</b>

04:22.460 --> 04:24.520
<b>Isn't it a little too quiet?</b>

04:26.490 --> 04:29.060
<b>There's no sign of any people.</b>

04:29.060 --> 04:31.970
<b>Maybe they're all out?</b>

04:31.970 --> 04:33.430
<b>Yeah, right!</b>

04:33.970 --> 04:37.540
<b>That hurt! Then, what could it be?!</b>

04:37.540 --> 04:41.600
<b>As if I'd know, but this isn't normal.</b>

04:42.240 --> 04:45.800
<b>There's no sign of animals,
much less people.</b>

04:47.380 --> 04:49.010
<b>Please take a look at that!</b>

04:50.090 --> 04:51.850
<b>Is something wrong with that?</b>

04:52.590 --> 04:54.560
<b>The water's dried up.</b>

04:54.560 --> 04:57.860
<b>There was no water in the waterways
along the way here either.</b>

04:57.860 --> 05:00.400
<b>But the strangest thing of all
is there are no plants,</b>

05:00.400 --> 05:04.570
<b>not even a single weed,
growing in this village!</b>

05:04.570 --> 05:06.430
<b>An abandoned village.</b>

05:06.430 --> 05:08.270
<b>Wrong.</b>

05:08.270 --> 05:10.970
<b>The buildings show no sign
of dilapidation.</b>

05:10.970 --> 05:12.600
<b>Then what in the world...</b>

05:21.920 --> 05:23.590
<b>What the heck are these?</b>

05:23.590 --> 05:25.210
<b>They seem to be coffins.</b>

05:26.820 --> 05:28.290
<b>What kind of joke is this?</b>

05:28.820 --> 05:32.160
<b>Welcome to my utopia.</b>

05:36.930 --> 05:39.600
<b>Do you like them?</b>

05:39.600 --> 05:43.000
<b>They're just a small present
from me to you.</b>

05:43.610 --> 05:45.170
<b>You can tell, can't you?</b>

05:45.170 --> 05:48.580
<b>I had them specially made just for you.</b>

05:48.580 --> 05:50.040
<b>You bastard!</b>

05:50.580 --> 05:52.210
<b>What did you do with the villagers?</b>

05:53.150 --> 05:55.550
<b>I erased them.</b>

05:55.550 --> 05:57.020
<b>What?!</b>

05:57.720 --> 06:00.120
<b>I like things very tidy, you see.</b>

06:00.120 --> 06:03.350
<b>I can't condone anything that would
mar the beauty of this village.</b>

06:03.930 --> 06:06.390
<b>What the heck is he talking about?</b>

06:06.390 --> 06:11.330
<b>Who knows? Maybe the heat
got to his brain?</b>

06:11.330 --> 06:14.970
<b>Your bravado won't last long.</b>

06:14.970 --> 06:20.040
<b>Why? Because you're fated
to be killed at my hands.</b>

06:20.040 --> 06:21.510
<b>Quit joking around!</b>

06:23.880 --> 06:26.710
<b>I haven't introduced myself to you yet.</b>

06:26.710 --> 06:30.840
<b>My name's the Undertaker.
That's what everyone calls me.</b>

06:31.590 --> 06:36.350
<b>I shall take it upon myself to send
you all into those coffins.</b>

06:36.890 --> 06:40.880
<b>Until then, please enjoy my village
as much as you can.</b>

07:12.490 --> 07:13.960
<b>So, what're we going to do?</b>

07:15.130 --> 07:18.290
<b>That guy seems to be pretty
gung-ho about this.</b>

07:19.330 --> 07:20.930
<b>I have no intention of running.</b>

07:22.300 --> 07:24.600
<b>If he wants something,
he'll come find us.</b>

07:26.070 --> 07:27.280
<b>No doubt about it.</b>

07:27.280 --> 07:31.910
<b>But where did the villagers vanish to?</b>

07:31.910 --> 07:33.380
<b>He killed them.</b>

07:35.150 --> 07:37.210
<b>It's faint, but I smell blood.</b>

07:38.850 --> 07:42.880
<b>Hey, did you notice?
This bar has no alcohol.</b>

07:43.690 --> 07:45.750
<b>What an elaborate welcome.</b>

07:55.470 --> 07:57.200
<b>Why isn't there any food?</b>

07:58.040 --> 07:59.970
<b>I wish there was some lying around
on the ground.</b>

08:04.580 --> 08:06.380
<b>Found some!</b>

08:06.380 --> 08:07.850
<b>No way!</b>

08:13.150 --> 08:14.590
<b>Thanks for the food!</b>

08:18.890 --> 08:20.950
<b>Too bad, Mr. Goku.</b>

08:23.430 --> 08:27.370
<b>But you're such a
straightforward person.</b>

08:30.240 --> 08:33.170
<b>I'm gonna beat the crap out of him
next time I see him!</b>

08:35.510 --> 08:39.880
<b>Damn it! I'm gonna find food
if it's the last thing I do!</b>

08:39.880 --> 08:42.280
<b>You spend the rest of your life
doing that, moron.</b>

08:44.650 --> 08:48.320
<b>Well? Are you enjoying yourself?</b>

08:48.320 --> 08:51.290
<b>Yeah, it's so fun, I'm
about to explode.</b>

08:51.290 --> 08:53.850
<b>I see. Well enough then.</b>

08:54.460 --> 08:58.500
<b>So, what are you trying to get by
annoying us on purpose?</b>

08:58.500 --> 08:59.970
<b>You infantile retard!</b>

09:01.440 --> 09:05.170
<b>I told you I like things very tidy.</b>

09:05.170 --> 09:09.130
<b>I erased everything in the village
that marred its beauty.</b>

09:09.710 --> 09:14.450
<b>Not to worry. I'll allow you
to join them very soon.</b>

09:14.450 --> 09:15.920
<b>Oh, really.</b>

09:16.620 --> 09:18.350
<b>Oh, no you don't, Mr. Gojyo.</b>

09:21.690 --> 09:24.260
<b>Bastard, that was all I had!</b>

09:24.260 --> 09:26.630
<b>Please, don't look so fierce.</b>

09:26.630 --> 09:30.160
<b>I'm only worrying about your health.</b>

09:30.160 --> 09:31.630
<b>Hey, did you know</b>

09:32.330 --> 09:35.970
<b>that up until now, there've been four
guys who suggested I quit smoking?</b>

09:35.970 --> 09:38.610
<b>What do you think they're doing now?</b>

09:38.610 --> 09:40.310
<b>Who knows?</b>

09:40.310 --> 09:42.800
<b>They've all gone to the world beyond!</b>

09:47.550 --> 09:52.220
<b>Well, please abstain, cleanly
and properly, Mr. Gojyo.</b>

09:52.220 --> 09:53.690
<b>Bastard!</b>

09:54.820 --> 09:56.360
<b>What do you think?</b>

09:56.360 --> 09:59.260
<b>Well, I really don't know what to say.</b>

10:00.190 --> 10:04.130
<b>I can understand when a weak guy
tries to use his wits, but...</b>

10:04.130 --> 10:08.430
<b>You don't like this performance, right?</b>

10:11.940 --> 10:13.410
<b>Sanzo, over there!</b>

10:15.610 --> 10:19.550
<b>So, the funeral preparations
are coming together?</b>

10:19.550 --> 10:21.070
<b>He's getting on my nerves.</b>

10:21.620 --> 10:23.450
<b>I'm hurt.</b>

10:23.450 --> 10:27.160
<b>I'm actually aiming for a very
natural performance here.</b>

10:27.160 --> 10:28.160
<b>Bastard.</b>

10:28.160 --> 10:30.220
<b>Everything's on schedule.</b>

10:30.220 --> 10:33.630
<b>Tomorrow morning, your
funeral will begin.</b>

10:33.630 --> 10:37.670
<b>Sorry, but it's not in my nature
to follow people's orders.</b>

10:37.670 --> 10:40.190
<b>We'll settle this here and now.</b>

10:44.570 --> 10:47.630
<b>Ah-ah, not so fast.</b>

10:55.220 --> 10:56.680
<b>Hakuryu!</b>

10:56.680 --> 10:58.150
<b>You let your guard down.</b>

11:11.000 --> 11:12.630
<b>Are you all right?!</b>

11:15.400 --> 11:18.170
<b>Hakuryu, are you all right?</b>

11:18.870 --> 11:20.340
<b>Hakuryu!</b>

11:21.610 --> 11:24.700
<b>I'm sorry. I was there,
and I wasn't able to...</b>

11:31.790 --> 11:34.150
<b>Thank goodness it wasn't serious.</b>

11:35.990 --> 11:39.860
<b>But picking on the weak
is unforgivable.</b>

11:39.860 --> 11:41.330
<b>Yeah...</b>

11:44.470 --> 11:49.170
<b>No water, no people, and most of all,
there's no food.</b>

11:49.170 --> 11:53.660
<b>No alcohol, no cigarettes, and most
of all, there are no women.</b>

11:54.210 --> 11:57.580
<b>Hey, Sanzo, let's just hurry up
and leave this village!</b>

11:57.580 --> 11:58.510
<b>I don't want to.</b>

11:58.510 --> 11:59.510
<b>Why not?!
I don't want to.</b>

11:59.510 --> 12:00.010
<b>Why not?!
After the way he's mocked us,</b>

12:00.010 --> 12:01.620
<b>After the way he's mocked us,</b>

12:01.620 --> 12:05.680
<b>"I'm not going to be satisfied until
we return the favor," right?</b>

12:06.590 --> 12:08.360
<b>You got it.</b>

12:08.360 --> 12:10.630
<b>Besides, he's not a moron either.</b>

12:10.630 --> 12:15.000
<b>He's gone to great lengths to
prepare a welcome for us.</b>

12:15.000 --> 12:16.700
<b>The least we can expect is to find
he's put up some sort of barrier</b>

12:16.700 --> 12:19.600
<b>to keep us from leaving the village.</b>

12:21.970 --> 12:24.770
<b>But it isn't a very good feeling, is it?</b>

12:24.770 --> 12:27.940
<b>It's as if he can read all of
our behavioral patterns.</b>

12:27.940 --> 12:30.240
<b>If you've got complaints,
tell it to these two.</b>

12:30.240 --> 12:31.710
<b>What did you say?!</b>

12:36.850 --> 12:39.650
<b>They're reacting as expected.</b>

12:39.650 --> 12:42.290
<b>But this is far from over.</b>

12:42.290 --> 12:46.060
<b>Why? Because the show time
has only just begun.</b>

12:52.970 --> 12:54.430
<b>Hey, Sanzo.</b>

12:55.540 --> 12:57.270
<b>Give me a smoke.</b>

12:57.270 --> 12:58.340
<b>I refuse.</b>

12:58.340 --> 13:01.780
<b>Don't be such a miser! And you
call yourself a monk?</b>

13:01.780 --> 13:04.110
<b>Do you remember what
you once told me?</b>

13:04.110 --> 13:07.980
<b>That my cigarettes taste bad and that
you don't want to smoke them.</b>

13:07.980 --> 13:11.790
<b>Quit remembering stupid things,
you baldy!</b>

13:11.790 --> 13:16.890
<b>Let go, or I'll kill you,
carrot-top Anne!</b>

13:16.890 --> 13:19.060
<b>What did you call me?!</b>

13:19.060 --> 13:23.360
<b>Both of you, I think it'd be better
if you left it at that.</b>

13:23.360 --> 13:27.390
<b>At that rate, you'll just play right
into the Undertaker's hands.</b>

13:31.970 --> 13:34.070
<b>You bastard!</b>

13:34.810 --> 13:36.910
<b>You son of a...</b>

13:36.910 --> 13:39.380
<b>I wonder if I've gone crazy?</b>

13:40.150 --> 13:43.380
<b>It looks like there's food
in front of me.</b>

13:43.380 --> 13:46.950
<b>You're not crazy. We can see it too.</b>

13:46.950 --> 13:48.290
<b>Then...</b>

13:48.290 --> 13:50.090
<b>Calm down, Goku.</b>

13:50.090 --> 13:51.560
<b>Take a good look around you.</b>

13:56.960 --> 13:58.030
<b>This is...</b>

13:58.030 --> 14:00.170
<b>This is just another of
his demonstrations.</b>

14:00.170 --> 14:02.140
<b>He's doing an elaborate job of it.</b>

14:02.140 --> 14:03.940
<b>Mister, I want food!</b>

14:03.940 --> 14:05.970
<b>I don't care what it is, as long
as it'll fill me up!</b>

14:05.970 --> 14:08.670
<b>I just told you it's not real!</b>

14:23.690 --> 14:24.790
<b>Bastard!</b>

14:24.790 --> 14:27.460
<b>Don't, that's an illusion too.</b>

14:43.140 --> 14:46.240
<b>Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!</b>

14:46.810 --> 14:49.020
<b>He sure is making a show of it.</b>

14:49.020 --> 14:52.050
<b>He seems to have rather poor taste.</b>

14:52.050 --> 14:54.820
<b>I can't take much more of this.</b>

14:54.820 --> 15:00.160
<b>Yeah, shall we close the curtains on
this three-penny performance?</b>

15:00.160 --> 15:01.800
<b>But how?</b>

15:01.800 --> 15:07.360
<b>Leave it to me. He's not the only one
who can piss people off.</b>

15:16.540 --> 15:18.210
<b>This feels so refreshing!</b>

15:18.210 --> 15:21.940
<b>I don't think I've felt this good
since we got to this village.</b>

15:25.290 --> 15:28.890
<b>Hey, Sanzo, is doing this really
going to make him show up?</b>

15:28.890 --> 15:31.880
<b>He'll come. This is his village, after all.</b>

15:33.530 --> 15:34.990
<b>Stop it!</b>

15:36.030 --> 15:37.300
<b>See?</b>

15:37.300 --> 15:38.770
<b>You're right.</b>

15:43.640 --> 15:46.440
<b>Stop it! What are you doing
to my village?!</b>

15:46.440 --> 15:49.310
<b>Please, stop it! Stop doing that!</b>

15:49.310 --> 15:51.840
<b>Then why don't you try
and make us stop?!</b>

15:57.920 --> 16:01.550
<b>If you don't hurry, there
won't be a village left!</b>

16:04.990 --> 16:09.660
<b>Stop it. This is my village.
It's my utopia.</b>

16:13.430 --> 16:15.070
<b>Fine then.</b>

16:15.070 --> 16:18.530
<b>It'll be a slight deviation of plans,
but playtime is over.</b>

16:27.580 --> 16:29.280
<b>It seems something's coming our way.</b>

16:29.280 --> 16:31.990
<b>It better be the real thing this time.</b>

16:31.990 --> 16:35.510
<b>You need not worry.
I'm physically here.</b>

16:36.660 --> 16:40.390
<b>You better be prepared, damn it!</b>

16:40.390 --> 16:42.960
<b>Prepared? Why, what do you mean?</b>

16:42.960 --> 16:47.270
<b>Looks like we'll have to teach him
just whom he picked a fight with.</b>

16:47.270 --> 16:50.400
<b>We'll make you feel sorry from
the bottom of your heart.</b>

16:50.400 --> 16:53.540
<b>You're the ones who'll be sorry.</b>

16:53.540 --> 16:57.610
<b>You'd have lived another half a day
if you hadn't angered me.</b>

16:57.610 --> 16:59.550
<b>I dare you to try it!</b>

16:59.550 --> 17:01.110
<b>Longer, nyoi-bou!</b>

17:07.220 --> 17:10.490
<b>Looks like you're good at scurrying
around, you hissy-fit bastard.</b>

17:16.530 --> 17:19.430
<b>You're rather monotonous.</b>

17:19.430 --> 17:22.500
<b>Who're you calling monotonous?</b>

17:22.500 --> 17:24.060
<b>I was talking about you.</b>

17:31.010 --> 17:32.450
<b>You bastard!</b>

17:32.450 --> 17:35.620
<b>It's useless. You had better not try it.</b>

17:35.620 --> 17:37.080
<b>I move too fast,</b>

17:37.080 --> 17:39.480
<b>so you were going to turn it into
close-quarters combat, right?</b>

17:40.590 --> 17:42.660
<b>I can tell, you see.</b>

17:42.660 --> 17:46.060
<b>What you're thinking. What your
next move will be.</b>

17:46.060 --> 17:47.760
<b>And your future.</b>

17:49.860 --> 17:52.870
<b>I think that's enough
self-advertisement.</b>

17:52.870 --> 17:55.100
<b>Being able to make sport of simpletons</b>

17:55.100 --> 17:56.900
<b>is nothing to brag about.</b>

17:56.900 --> 18:00.140
<b>My clothing... My clothing...</b>

18:01.010 --> 18:03.680
<b>I'll kill you. I'll...</b>

18:03.680 --> 18:05.470
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

18:09.420 --> 18:10.220
<b>Thanks.</b>

18:10.220 --> 18:13.690
<b>Not at all. But these coffins are
rather troublesome.</b>

18:13.690 --> 18:16.320
<b>They're projectile weapons, but at the
same time, they can be shields.</b>

18:16.320 --> 18:18.730
<b>Definitely troublesome.</b>

18:18.730 --> 18:20.190
<b>At times like these...</b>

18:26.770 --> 18:28.230
<b>I see it!</b>

18:34.280 --> 18:38.780
<b>I told you I know the kinds of things
you'll think up, didn't I?!</b>

18:38.780 --> 18:42.520
<b>Goku, Gojyo, destroy
those coffins first!</b>

18:42.520 --> 18:45.350
<b>Once we do that, he'll be as good
as naked, right?!</b>

18:45.350 --> 18:47.290
<b>Then let's hurry up and do it!</b>

18:49.460 --> 18:52.830
<b>It's useless. You won't break them
so easily.</b>

18:52.830 --> 18:54.290
<b>What?!</b>

18:55.400 --> 18:56.860
<b>My turn now?</b>

19:00.200 --> 19:01.470
<b>Impossible!</b>

19:01.470 --> 19:03.230
<b>Don't think you'll die an easy death!</b>

19:03.940 --> 19:07.640
<b>Stay away! Stay away from me!</b>

19:07.640 --> 19:10.800
<b>I'm first! This is for my food grudge!</b>

19:17.720 --> 19:19.390
<b>I'm next.</b>

19:19.390 --> 19:21.550
<b>This is thanks for the no-smoking-Hell!</b>

19:26.560 --> 19:29.590
<b>Don't worry. I'm not mad at you.</b>

19:32.730 --> 19:34.200
<b>And this is the end.</b>

19:41.580 --> 19:43.410
<b>Makai Tenjou!</b>

19:46.080 --> 19:48.280
<b>Looks like you picked a fight
with the wrong guys!</b>

19:50.150 --> 19:52.850
<b>Lord Homura!</b>

19:52.850 --> 19:54.050
<b>What?!</b>

19:54.050 --> 19:55.920
<b>Homura! He just said Homura!</b>

20:02.060 --> 20:04.030
<b>Does it still bother you?</b>

20:04.030 --> 20:05.800
<b>Kinda.</b>

20:05.800 --> 20:07.940
<b>But man, there really was
nothing in that village.</b>

20:07.940 --> 20:11.070
<b>Being in a place like that for three
days is enough to make you crazy!</b>

20:11.070 --> 20:14.280
<b>Same here. It was truly like Hell.</b>

20:14.280 --> 20:16.910
<b>No alcohol, no cigarettes
and no food.</b>

20:16.910 --> 20:20.580
<b>That might actually be what
Heaven is like.</b>

20:20.580 --> 20:23.920
<b>Gag, then I'd rather go to Hell.</b>

20:23.920 --> 20:25.590
<b>Idiot.</b>

20:25.590 --> 20:28.420
<b>It's already been decided
where we're going.</b>

20:28.420 --> 20:31.690
<b>Well, well, so is that Hell after all?</b>

20:31.690 --> 20:33.180
<b>No...</b>

20:34.930 --> 20:36.400
<b>West!</b>

20:46.140 --> 20:54.980
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina
omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:56.320 --> 21:06.750
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou no
naka ni ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:08.100 --> 21:18.230
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:19.540 --> 21:32.550
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta kotoba ga
fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:32.550 --> 21:44.000
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:44.000 --> 21:55.280
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi ga
tashika ni natteku</b>

21:55.280 --> 22:07.450
<b>ima nara kitto aruite yukeru
doko made mo</b>
